# Kima Scent — Advanced Business Management, Analytics & Operations Upgrade

Upgrade the existing Kima Scent Wholesale Management System into a professional, scalable wholesale business management and analytics platform.

This is an enhancement of the existing production application, NOT a rebuild.

## 0. Critical Instructions

Before writing or modifying any code:

1. Inspect the current project architecture, database schema, API endpoints, role permissions, invoice workflow, inventory logic, commissions, reports, and existing Owner Control Center.
2. Identify the actual cause of any conflicting or incomplete functionality before fixing it.
3. Reuse existing components, tables, business logic, design system, and infrastructure wherever possible.
4. Do not rebuild the project, replace its architecture, or migrate its database.
5. Do not remove, rename, or break existing working features.
6. Preserve all real users, credentials, permissions, historical invoices, customers, products, stock movements, commission snapshots, and audit records.
7. Do not run destructive operations on the production database during development or testing.
8. Do not expose sensitive business data across salesperson accounts.
9. Do not claim a feature is completed unless it has been implemented and tested.

Implement the following upgrade as a cohesive feature set with appropriate database migrations, backend logic, frontend UI, permissions, reports, and automated tests.

